module.exports = JSON.parse('{"A service can live in any VPC or account and can run on instances, containers, or serverless compute. A service consists of listeners, rules, and target groups, similar to an AWS Application Load Balancer.":"Layanan dapat hidup di VPC atau akun apa pun dan dapat berjalan di instans, kontainer, atau komputasi nirserver. Layanan terdiri dari pendengar, aturan, dan grup target, mirip dengan AWS Penyeimbang Beban Aplikasi.","AWS Cloud WAN":"WAN AWS Cloud","AWS Verified Access":"Akses Terverifikasi AWS","AWS Verified Access enables customers to provide secure, VPN-less access to their corporate applications. ":"Akses Terverifikasi AWS memungkinkan pelanggan untuk menyediakan akses aman tanpa VPN ke aplikasi perusahaan mereka. ","An unexpected error occurred when loading the VPC console. Please try reloading the page.":"Terjadi kesalahan tak terduga saat memuat konsol VPC. Harap coba muat ulang halaman.","Carrier gateways":"Gateway pembawa","Client VPN endpoints":"Titik akhir VPN Klien","Close left console navigation drawer":"Tutup laci navigasi konsol kiri","Cloud WAN":"Cloud WAN","Customer gateways":"Gateway pelanggan","DHCP option sets":"Set opsi DHCP","DNS firewall":"Firewall DNS","Domain lists":"Daftar domain","EC2 Global View":"Tampilan Global EC2","Egress-only internet gateways":"Gateway internet khusus Egress","Elastic IPs":"IP Elastis","Enable access to your corporate applications via AWS Verified Access by creating endpoints for your applications.":"Aktifkan akses ke aplikasi perusahaan Anda melalui Akses Terverifikasi AWS dengan membuat titik akhir untuk aplikasi.","Endpoint services":"Layanan titik akhir","Endpoints":"Titik akhir","Error loading VPCs.":"Kesalahan saat memuat VPC.","Filter by VPC:":"Filter berdasarkan VPC:","Firewall policies":"Kebijakan firewall","Firewalls":"Firewall","Getting started":"Memulai","Group multiple applications that share similar access policies together with a Verified Access group. Each group has an access policy that applies to all endpoints you define in that group.":"Kelompokkan beberapa aplikasi yang berbagi kebijakan akses serupa bersama dengan grup Akses Terverifikasi. Setiap grup memiliki kebijakan akses yang berlaku untuk semua titik akhir yang Anda tetapkan dalam grup tersebut.","Integrate with services that provide security data to verify a user\'s request.":"Integrasikan dengan layanan yang menyediakan data keamanan untuk memverifikasi permintaan pengguna.","Internet gateways":"Gateway internet","Introducing AWS Verified Access":"Memperkenalkan Akses Terverifikasi AWS","Learn how Amazon VPC Lattice simplifies service-to-service connectivity, security, and monitoring. Get details on features, use cases, pricing, and more.":"Pelajari cara Amazon VPC Lattice menyederhanakan konektivitas, keamanan, dan pemantauan layanan-ke-layanan. Dapatkan detail tentang fitur, kasus penggunaan, harga, dan lainnya.","Learn more":"Pelajari selengkapnya","Managed prefix lists":"Daftar prefiks terkelola","Mirror filters":"Filter cermin","Mirror sessions":"Sesi cermin","Mirror targets":"Target cermin","NAT gateways":"Gateway NAT","Network ACLs":"ACL jaringan","Network Access Analyzer":"Penganalisis Akses Jaringan","Network Analysis":"Analisis Jaringan","Network Firewall":"Firewall Jaringan","Network Firewall resource groups":"Grup sumber daya Network Firewall","Network Firewall rule groups":"Grup aturan Network Firewall","Network Manager":"Network Manager","New":"Baru","Open left console navigation drawer":"Buka laci navigasi konsol kiri","Opens in a new tab":"Terbuka di tab baru","Owner: {{ownerId}}":"Pemilik: {{ownerId}}","Peering connections":"Koneksi peering","Preview":"Pratinjau","Reachability":"Keterjangkauan","Reachability Analyzer":"Reachability Analyzer","Retry":"Coba lagi","Route tables":"Tabel rute","Rule groups":"Grup aturan","Security":"Keamanan","Security groups":"Grup keamanan","Select a VPC":"Pilih VPC","Selected":"Dipilih","Service networks":"Jaringan layanan","Service networks provide a logical grouping mechanism to simplify connectivity and apply common policies to a collection of services. Service networks can be shared across accounts with AWS RAM and associated with VPCs to enable connectivity to a group of services.":"Jaringan layanan menyediakan mekanisme pengelompokan logis untuk menyederhanakan konektivitas dan menerapkan kebijakan umum ke kumpulan layanan. Jaringan layanan dapat dibagikan di seluruh akun dengan AWS RAM dan dikaitkan dengan VPC untuk mengaktifkan konektivitas ke grup layanan.","Services":"Layanan","Settings":"Pengaturan","Site-to-Site VPN connections":"Koneksi Site-to-Site VPN","Subnets":"Subnet","TLS inspection configurations":"Konfigurasi pemeriksaan TLS","Target groups":"Grup target","Target groups contain targets (instances, IPs, containers or serverless functions) that run services. Routing rules defined within a service direct requests to specified target groups.":"Grup target berisi target (instans, IP, kontainer, atau fungsi nirserver) yang menjalankan layanan. Routing aturan didefinisikan dalam permintaan langsung layanan untuk kelompok target tertentu.","Traffic Mirroring":"Pencerminan Lalu Lintas","Transit gateway attachments":"Transit gateway attachment","Transit gateway multicast":"Transit gateway multicast","Transit gateway policy tables":"Tabel kebijakan gateway transit","Transit gateway route tables":"Tabel rute transit gateway","Transit gateways":"Transit gateway","VPC IP Address Manager":"Pengelola Alamat IP VPC","VPC Lattice":"Lattice VPC","VPC dashboard":"Dasbor VPC","Verified Access endpoints":"Titik Akhir Akses Terverifikasi","Verified Access groups":"Grup Akses Terverifikasi","Verified Access instances":"Instans Akses Terverifikasi","Verified Access trust providers":"Penyedia kepercayaan Akses Terverifikasi","Virtual private cloud":"Virtual private cloud","Virtual private gateways":"Gateway privat virtual","Virtual private network (VPN)":"Jaringan pribadi virtual (VPN)","Your VPCs":"VPC Anda"}');

