/***/ 9492:
/***/ ((module) => {

"use strict";
module.exports = JSON.parse('{"A service can live in any VPC or account and can run on instances, containers, or serverless compute. A service consists of listeners, rules, and target groups, similar to an AWS Application Load Balancer.":"サービスは任意の VPC またはアカウントに存在し、インスタンス、コンテナ、またはサーバーレスコンピューティングで実行できます。サービスは、AWS Application Load Balancer と同様に、リスナー、ルール、ターゲットグループで構成されます。","AWS Cloud WAN":"AWS Cloud WAN","AWS Verified Access":"AWS Verified Access","AWS Verified Access enables customers to provide secure, VPN-less access to their corporate applications. ":"AWS 検証済みアクセスにより、お客様は企業アプリケーションへ VPN なしでセキュアなアクセスを提供できます。","An unexpected error occurred when loading the VPC console. Please try reloading the page.":"VPC コンソールのロード中に予期しないエラーが発生しました。ページを再ロードしてみてください。","Carrier gateways":"キャリアゲートウェイ","Client VPN endpoints":"クライアント VPN エンドポイント","Close left console navigation drawer":"左側のコンソールナビゲーションドロワーを閉じる","Cloud WAN":"Cloud WAN","Customer gateways":"カスタマーゲートウェイ","DHCP option sets":"DHCP オプションセット","DNS firewall":"DNS ファイアウォール","Domain lists":"ドメインリスト","EC2 Global View":"EC2 グローバルビュー","Egress-only internet gateways":"Egress-only インターネットゲートウェイ","Elastic IPs":"Elastic IP","Enable access to your corporate applications via AWS Verified Access by creating endpoints for your applications.":"アプリケーションのエンドポイントを作成すれば、AWS Verified Access により企業アプリケーションへのアクセスが可能になります。","Endpoint services":"エンドポイントサービス","Endpoints":"エンドポイント","Error loading VPCs.":"VPC のロード中にエラーが発生しました","Filter by VPC:":"VPC でフィルタリング:","Firewall policies":"ファイアウォールポリシー","Firewalls":"ファイアウォール","Getting started":"開始方法","Group multiple applications that share similar access policies together with a Verified Access group. Each group has an access policy that applies to all endpoints you define in that group.":"類似したアクセスポリシーを共有する複数のアプリケーションを Verified Access グループと共にグループ化します。各グループは、そのグループで定義するすべてのエンドポイントに適用されるアクセスポリシーを持ちます。","Integrate with services that provide security data to verify a user\'s request.":"ユーザーのリクエストを検証するセキュリティデータを提供するサービスと統合します。","Internet gateways":"インターネットゲートウェイ","Introducing AWS Verified Access":"AWS Verified Access の紹介","Learn how Amazon VPC Lattice simplifies service-to-service connectivity, security, and monitoring. Get details on features, use cases, pricing, and more.":"Amazon VPC Lattice がサービス間の接続、セキュリティ、モニタリングをどのように簡素化するのかをご確認いただけます。また、機能、ユースケース、料金などの詳細をご覧ください。","Learn more":"詳細はこちら","Managed prefix lists":"マネージドプレフィックスリスト","Mirror filters":"ミラーフィルター","Mirror sessions":"ミラーセッション","Mirror targets":"ミラーターゲット","NAT gateways":"NAT ゲートウェイ","Network ACLs":"ネットワーク ACL","Network Access Analyzer":"Network Access Analyzer","Network Analysis":"ネットワーク分析","Network Firewall":"ネットワークファイアウォール","Network Firewall resource groups":"ネットワークファイアウォールリソースグループ","Network Firewall rule groups":"Network Firewall のルールグループ","Network Manager":"ネットワークマネージャー","New":"新規","Open left console navigation drawer":"左側のコンソールナビゲーションドロワーを開く","Opens in a new tab":"新しいタブで開きます","Owner: {{ownerId}}":"所有者: {{ownerId}}","Peering connections":"ピアリング接続","Preview":"プレビュー","Reachability":"到達可能性","Reachability Analyzer":"Reachability Analyzer","Retry":"再試行","Route tables":"ルートテーブル","Rule groups":"ルールグループ","Security":"セキュリティ","Security groups":"セキュリティグループ","Select a VPC":"VPC を選択","Selected":"選択済み","Service networks":"サービスネットワーク","Service networks provide a logical grouping mechanism to simplify connectivity and apply common policies to a collection of services. Service networks can be shared across accounts with AWS RAM and associated with VPCs to enable connectivity to a group of services.":"サービスネットワークは接続を簡素化し、共通のポリシーをサービスのコレクションに適用するための論理的なグループ化のメカニズムを提供します。サービスネットワークは、サービスのグループへの接続を可能するために、AWS RAM を使用してアカウント間で共有され、VPC に関連付けられることがあります。","Services":"サービス","Settings":"設定","Site-to-Site VPN connections":"Site-to-Site VPN 接続","Subnets":"サブネット","TLS inspection configurations":"TLS 検査設定","Target groups":"ターゲットグループ","Target groups contain targets (instances, IPs, containers or serverless functions) that run services. Routing rules defined within a service direct requests to specified target groups.":"ターゲットグループには、サービスを実行するターゲット（インスタンス、IP、コンテナ、またはサーバーレス関数）が含まれます。サービス内で定義されたルーティングルールは、指定されたターゲットグループにリクエストを送信します。","Traffic Mirroring":"トラフィックミラーリング","Transit gateway attachments":"Transit Gateway アタッチメント","Transit gateway multicast":"Transit Gateway Multicast","Transit gateway policy tables":"Transit Gateway ポリシーテーブル","Transit gateway route tables":"Transit Gateway ルートテーブル","Transit gateways":"Transit Gateway","VPC IP Address Manager":"VPC IP アドレスマネージャー","VPC Lattice":"VPC Lattice","VPC dashboard":"VPC ダッシュボード","Verified Access endpoints":"Verified Access エンドポイント","Verified Access groups":"Verified Access グループ","Verified Access instances":"Verified Access インスタンス","Verified Access trust providers":"Verified Access 信頼プロバイダー","Virtual private cloud":"仮想プライベートクラウド","Virtual private gateways":"仮想プライベートゲートウェイ","Virtual private network (VPN)":"仮想プライベートネットワーク (VPN)","Your VPCs":"お使いの VPC"}');

/***/ }),

/***/ 83070:
/***/ ((module) => {

"use strict";
module.exports = JSON.parse('{"A service can live in any VPC or account and can run on instances, containers, or serverless compute. A service consists of listeners, rules, and target groups, similar to an AWS Application Load Balancer.":"서비스는 모든 VPC 또는 계정에 있을 수 있으며 인스턴스, 컨테이너 또는 서버리스 컴퓨팅에서 실행할 수 있습니다. 서비스는 AWS Application Load Balancer와 유사한 리스너, 규칙 및 대상 그룹으로 구성됩니다.","AWS Cloud WAN":"AWS 클라우드 WAN","AWS Verified Access":"AWS가 확인한 액세스","AWS Verified Access enables customers to provide secure, VPN-less access to their corporate applications. ":"AWS가 확인한 액세스를 통해 고객은 회사 애플리케이션에 VPN 없이 안전하게 액세스할 수 있습니다. ","An unexpected error occurred when loading the VPC console. Please try reloading the page.":"VPC 콘솔을 로드하는 동안 예상치 못한 오류가 발생했습니다. 페이지를 다시 로드해 보세요.","Carrier gateways":"캐리어 게이트웨이","Client VPN endpoints":"Client VPN 엔드포인트","Close left console navigation drawer":"왼쪽 콘솔 탐색 창 닫기","Cloud WAN":"Cloud WAN","Customer gateways":"고객 게이트웨이","DHCP option sets":"DHCP 옵션 세트","DNS firewall":"DNS 방화벽","Domain lists":"도메인 목록","EC2 Global View":"EC2 글로벌 보기","Egress-only internet gateways":"송신 전용 인터넷 게이트웨이","Elastic IPs":"탄력적 IP","Enable access to your corporate applications via AWS Verified Access by creating endpoints for your applications.":"애플리케이션에 대한 엔드포인트를 생성하여 AWS가 확인한 액세스를 통해 기업 애플리케이션에 액세스할 수 있도록 합니다.","Endpoint services":"엔드포인트 서비스","Endpoints":"엔드포인트","Error loading VPCs.":"VPC 로드 중 오류가 발생했습니다.","Filter by VPC:":"VPC로 필터링:","Firewall policies":"방화벽 정책","Firewalls":"방화벽","Getting started":"시작하기","Group multiple applications that share similar access policies together with a Verified Access group. Each group has an access policy that applies to all endpoints you define in that group.":"유사한 액세스 정책을 공유하는 여러 애플리케이션을 확인된 액세스 그룹과 함께 그룹화합니다. 각 그룹에는 해당 그룹에서 정의한 모든 엔드포인트에 적용되는 액세스 정책이 있습니다.","Integrate with services that provide security data to verify a user\'s request.":"보안 데이터를 제공하는 서비스와 통합하여 사용자의 요청을 확인합니다.","Internet gateways":"인터넷 게이트웨이","Introducing AWS Verified Access":"AWS가 확인한 액세스 소개","Learn how Amazon VPC Lattice simplifies service-to-service connectivity, security, and monitoring. Get details on features, use cases, pricing, and more.":"Amazon VPC Lattice로 서비스 간 연결, 보안 및 모니터링을 간소화하는 방법을 알아보고 기능, 사용 사례, 요금 등에 대한 세부 정보를 확인하세요.","Learn more":"자세히 알아보기","Managed prefix lists":"관리형 접두사 목록","Mirror filters":"미러 필터","Mirror sessions":"미러 세션","Mirror targets":"미러 대상","NAT gateways":"NAT 게이트웨이","Network ACLs":"네트워크 ACL","Network Access Analyzer":"Network Access Analyzer","Network Analysis":"네트워크 분석","Network Firewall":"네트워크 방화벽","Network Firewall resource groups":"네트워크 방화벽 리소스 그룹","Network Firewall rule groups":"Network Firewall 규칙 그룹","Network Manager":"네트워크 관리자","New":"신규","Open left console navigation drawer":"왼쪽 콘솔 탐색 창 열기","Opens in a new tab":"새 탭에서 열기","Owner: {{ownerId}}":"소유자: {{ownerId}}","Peering connections":"피어링 연결","Preview":"미리 보기","Reachability":"도달성","Reachability Analyzer":"Reachability Analyzer","Retry":"재시도","Route tables":"라우팅 테이블","Rule groups":"규칙 그룹","Security":"보안","Security groups":"보안 그룹","Select a VPC":"VPC 선택","Selected":"선택됨","Service networks":"서비스 네트워크","Service networks provide a logical grouping mechanism to simplify connectivity and apply common policies to a collection of services. Service networks can be shared across accounts with AWS RAM and associated with VPCs to enable connectivity to a group of services.":"서비스 네트워크는 연결을 간소화하고 공통 정책을 서비스 모음에 적용하는 논리적 그룹화 메커니즘을 제공합니다. 서비스 네트워크는 AWS RAM과 계정 간에 공유되고 VPC와 연결하여 서비스 그룹에 연결할 수 있습니다.","Services":"서비스","Settings":"설정","Site-to-Site VPN connections":"Site-to-Site VPN 연결","Subnets":"서브넷","TLS inspection configurations":"TLS 검사 구성","Target groups":"대상 그룹","Target groups contain targets (instances, IPs, containers or serverless functions) that run services. Routing rules defined within a service direct requests to specified target groups.":"대상 그룹에는 서비스를 실행하는 대상(인스턴스, IP, 컨테이너 또는 서버리스 기능)이 포함됩니다. 서비스 내에서 정의된 라우팅 규칙은 지정된 대상 그룹으로 요청을 보냅니다.","Traffic Mirroring":"트래픽 미러링","Transit gateway attachments":"Transit Gateway 연결","Transit gateway multicast":"Transit Gateway 멀티캐스트","Transit gateway policy tables":"Transit Gateway 정책 테이블","Transit gateway route tables":"Transit Gateway 라우팅 테이블","Transit gateways":"Transit Gateway","VPC IP Address Manager":"VPC IP 주소 관리자","VPC Lattice":"VPC 래티스","VPC dashboard":"VPC 대시보드","Verified Access endpoints":"확인된 액세스 엔드포인트","Verified Access groups":"확인된 액세스 그룹","Verified Access instances":"확인된 액세스 인스턴스","Verified Access trust providers":"확인된 액세스 신뢰 공급자","Virtual private cloud":"Virtual Private Cloud","Virtual private gateways":"가상 프라이빗 게이트웨이","Virtual private network (VPN)":"가상 사설 네트워크(VPN)","Your VPCs":"VPC"}');

