"use strict";
module.exports = JSON.parse('{"A service can live in any VPC or account and can run on instances, containers, or serverless compute. A service consists of listeners, rules, and target groups, similar to an AWS Application Load Balancer.":"服務可以存在於任何 VPC 或帳戶中，並且可在執行個體、容器或無伺服器運算上執行。服務由接聽程式、規則和目標群組組成，類似 AWS Application Load Balancer。","AWS Cloud WAN":"AWS 雲端 WAN","AWS Verified Access":"AWS Verified Access","AWS Verified Access enables customers to provide secure, VPN-less access to their corporate applications. ":"AWS Verified Access 可讓客戶為公司應用程式提供安全、無需 VPN 的存取。","An unexpected error occurred when loading the VPC console. Please try reloading the page.":"載入 VPC 主控台時發生非預期錯誤。請嘗試重新載入頁面。","Carrier gateways":"電信業者閘道","Client VPN endpoints":"用戶端 VPN 端點","Close left console navigation drawer":"關閉左側主控台抽屜式導覽","Cloud WAN":"雲端 WAN","Customer gateways":"客戶閘道","DHCP option sets":"DHCP 選項集","DNS firewall":"DNS 防火牆","Domain lists":"網域清單","EC2 Global View":"EC2 全域視圖","Egress-only internet gateways":"輸出限定網際網路閘道","Elastic IPs":"彈性 IP","Enable access to your corporate applications via AWS Verified Access by creating endpoints for your applications.":"為您的應用程式建立端點，以透過 AWS Verified Acces 來存取您的公司應用程式。","Endpoint services":"端點服務","Endpoints":"端點","Error loading VPCs.":"載入 VPC 時發生錯誤。","Filter by VPC:":"依 VPC 篩選：","Firewall policies":"防火牆政策","Firewalls":"防火牆","Getting started":"開始使用","Group multiple applications that share similar access policies together with a Verified Access group. Each group has an access policy that applies to all endpoints you define in that group.":"將共用類似存取政策的多個應用程式與 Verified Access 群組結合使用。每個群組都有適用於您在該群組中定義的所有端點的存取政策。","Integrate with services that provide security data to verify a user\'s request.":"與提供安全資料以驗證使用者請求的服務整合。","Internet gateways":"網際網路閘道","Introducing AWS Verified Access":"AWS Verified Access 簡介","Learn how Amazon VPC Lattice simplifies service-to-service connectivity, security, and monitoring. Get details on features, use cases, pricing, and more.":"了解 Amazon VPC Lattice 如何簡化服務間的連線、安全性和監控。取得各項功能、使用案例、定價等方面的詳細資訊。","Learn more":"進一步了解","Managed prefix lists":"受管前綴清單","Mirror filters":"鏡像篩選條件","Mirror sessions":"鏡像工作階段","Mirror targets":"鏡像目標","NAT gateways":"NAT 閘道","Network ACLs":"網路 ACL","Network Access Analyzer":"Network Access Analyzer","Network Analysis":"網路分析","Network Firewall":"Network Firewall","Network Firewall resource groups":"Network Firewall 資源群組","Network Firewall rule groups":"Network Firewall 規則群組","Network Manager":"網路管理員","New":"全新","Open left console navigation drawer":"開啟左側主控台抽屜式導覽","Opens in a new tab":"在新索引標籤中開啟","Owner: {{ownerId}}":"擁有者：{{ownerId}}","Peering connections":"對等連線","Preview":"預覽","Reachability":"連線性","Reachability Analyzer":"Reachability Analyzer","Retry":"重試","Route tables":"路由表","Rule groups":"規則群組","Security":"安全","Security groups":"安全群組","Select a VPC":"選取 VPC","Selected":"已選取","Service networks":"服務網路","Service networks provide a logical grouping mechanism to simplify connectivity and apply common policies to a collection of services. Service networks can be shared across accounts with AWS RAM and associated with VPCs to enable connectivity to a group of services.":"服務網路提供邏輯分組機制，以簡化連線並對服務集合套用常用政策。服務網路可在具有 AWS RAM 的帳戶之間共用，並與 VPC 建立關聯，以啟用對服務群組的連線。","Services":"服務","Settings":"設定","Site-to-Site VPN connections":"Site-to-Site VPN 連線","Subnets":"子網路","TLS inspection configurations":"TLS 檢查組態","Target groups":"目標群組","Target groups contain targets (instances, IPs, containers or serverless functions) that run services. Routing rules defined within a service direct requests to specified target groups.":"目標群組包含執行服務的目標 (執行個體、IP、容器或無伺服器函數)。路由服務內定義的規則會將請求直接導向指定的目標群組。","Traffic Mirroring":"流量鏡像","Transit gateway attachments":"傳輸閘道連接","Transit gateway multicast":"傳輸閘道多點傳送","Transit gateway policy tables":"傳輸閘道政策表","Transit gateway route tables":"傳輸閘道路由表","Transit gateways":"傳輸閘道","VPC IP Address Manager":"VPC IP 地址管理員","VPC Lattice":"VPC Lattice","VPC dashboard":"VPC 儀表板","Verified Access endpoints":"Verified Access 端點","Verified Access groups":"Verified Access 群組","Verified Access instances":"Verified Access 執行個體","Verified Access trust providers":"Verified Access 信任提供者","Virtual private cloud":"Virtual Private Cloud","Virtual private gateways":"虛擬私有閘道","Virtual private network (VPN)":"虛擬私有網路 (VPN)","Your VPCs":"您的 VPC"}');

